    "Cube2 means x/z centered and y from0 to1000*scale_y; no attached external form matrix for these ordinary SwitchCube placements.",
    "Surface accessibility is unproven; especially hole75% may be inside the crater shaft and requires walking into the opening. Use this direction for navigation, not teleportation.",
